+#: "legacy_v10" (2026-11-21): register `item_dependencies` and `dependency_declaration` on `backlog`, `spec`, and `research` so non-IPD dependency edges reach the cache and `attention.scan()`.
+LEGACY_LOADER_VERSION = "legacy_v10"
